\cref{fig:euler_char_compose} is a graphical representation of the composite of Euler characteristics where we have nested the red/green dual pair inside the  orange/blue dual pair. Following \cref{fig:morita} we can first cancel the concentric green and orange regions resulting in \cref{fig:euler_char_compose_2}.  Then the  red and blue regions cancel.  

