\]
and the trace of $\rsm{\eta}MNQ$ is 
\[
 \sh{Q}\cong \sh{Q\odot U_C}\xrightarrow{\sh{\id_Q\odot \eta}}\sh{Q\odot M\odot N}\cong \sh{N\odot Q\odot M}.
\]

Composing these maps in both orders we have the following commutative diagrams.
\[\xymatrix{
 \sh{N\odot Q\odot M}\ar[r]^-{\theta}\ar[dddrrrr]^\id
