coevaluation is
\begin{align*}
 {\sA}(a,a')\xrightarrow{F} \sC(F(a),F(a'))&\cong \sC(F(a),F(a'))\otimes 1_{\sV}
 \\
 &\to \sC(F(a),F(a'))\otimes\sC(F(a'),F(a'))\to \sC(F(a),-)\odot\sC(-,F(a')) 
\end{align*}
For objects 
$c,c'$ of $\sC$, the corresponding  evaluation 
is induced by the composition of morphisms as in the following diagram.
\[\xymatrix{ 
  \coprod_{a\in \scr{A}} \sC(c,F(a))\otimes \sC(F(a),c') \ar[r]\ar[d]
  &\sC(c,c')
  \\
