\label{left_or_right_for_trace} 
If $(M,N)$ is a dual pair, the {\bf dual} of a map 
$g\colon N\odot Q\to P\odot N$, denoted $g^\star$, is the composite 
\begin{align*}
	Q\odot M\xrightarrow{\rsm{\eta}{M}{N}{Q}}
